---
description: Shared types, Zod schemas, and constants
globs: types/**/*.ts,validations/**/*.ts,constants/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# types/, validations/, constants/

## types/

- `types/database.ts` — generated (`supabase gen types typescript`). Never hand-edit
- Per-entity domain types on top of DB types: `types/project.ts`
- Re-export from `types/index.ts` when useful

## validations/

- One Zod file per entity: `validations/project.ts`
- Share the same schema in `react-hook-form` (`zodResolver` from `@hookform/resolvers/zod`) and Server Actions — write once, validate twice

## constants/

- DB enums, route paths, config values, feature flags
